## Why This Is Asked
Tests mastery of in-place merging, a practical skill when space is constrained.

## Key Concepts
- In-place merging with end pointers
- Time O(m+n), space O(1)
- Edge cases: empty arrays, duplicates, negative numbers

## Code Example
```javascript
function mergeInPlace(A, m, B, n) {
  let i = m - 1, j = n - 1, k = m + n - 1;
  while (j >= 0) {
    if (i >= 0 && A[i] > B[j]) {
      A[k--] = A[i--];
    } else {
      A[k--] = B[j--];
    }
  }
}
```

